  "item_short_desc": "<p>Our Midnight Camo Every Day Hoodie is the last sweatshirt you&rsquo;ll ever need or want! These hooded pullover sweatshirts are an absolute game changer, as they give you the freedom to comfortably work, play, or lounge from the get-go. Without a doubt, this hooded sweatshirt will become part of your go-to wardrobe. They&rsquo;re great for working outside, chilling around the campfire, traveling around, and other various activities!</p>",
