  "description": "<p>Our Midnight Camo Every Day Hoodie is the last sweatshirt you&rsquo;ll ever need or want! These hooded pullover sweatshirts are an absolute game changer, as they give you the freedom to comfortably work, play, or lounge from the get-go. Without a doubt, this hooded sweatshirt will become part of your go-to wardrobe. They&rsquo;re great for working outside, chilling around the campfire, traveling around, and other various activities! Ultimate Stealth Ops Camo: Inspired by stealth military operations that require zero visibility to the opposition, Rothco has reinvented the classic Woodland Camouflage Pattern as well as our bestselling Black Camouflage Pattern to bring you the Midnight Camo Collection. The subdued color combinations offer a true stealth, sharp and sleek appearance whether on mission or off. Debuting in our top performing apparel, outerwear, and headwear; get ready to light up the darkness with the Rothco Midnight Camo Collection. Move Around Freely: These heavy-duty hoodies feature active stretch side panels that enhance your field of motion, providing you with increased mobility. The elastic ribbed knit cuffs and waist conform to your body without restricting your movement. These pullover hoodie sweatshirts also feature a tag-less neck label for added convenience. Pullover Warmth &amp; Utility: With a warm inner fleece and super soft feel that doesn&rsquo;t go away after multiple washes, these pullover hooded sweatshirts provide all-day comfort and style. The insulating double-layer drawstring hood keeps your head and neck warm, while protecting against cold wind and rain. The large front kangaroo pocket provides ample storage space, and is great for warming your hands. Tough and Durable Construction: We didn&rsquo;t invent the hoodie, but we did perfect it with a warm and comfortable 8.3 Oz cotton blend composition that you&rsquo;ll never want to take off. These hoodie sweatshirts are designed for every day wear, and can be worn in a variety of environments. You work hard every day. Let the Every Day Hoodie work for you. Perfect Fit for Everyone: These dependably warm pullover hoodie sweatshirts are a great fit for anyone. This is the one hooded sweatshirt you&rsquo;ll want to keep nearby, and perhaps keep an extra, just in case.</p>",
